#. module: incubacloud
#: model:mail.template,body_html:incubacloud.mail_template_backup_usage_alert
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"    <p>Hello,</p>\n"
"    <p>The backup backend\n"
"        <strong t-out=\"object.name\"/>\n"
"        is currently at\n"
"        <strong><t t-out=\"ctx.get('backup_alert_pct_used')\"/>%</strong>\n"
"        of its configured quota\n"
"        (<t t-out=\"round(object.last_measured_gb, 2)\"/> GB used of\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.quota_gb\"/> GB quota; alert threshold is\n"
"        <t t-out=\"ctx.get('backup_alert_threshold_pct')\"/>%).</p>\n"
"    <p>Bucket: <code t-out=\"object.s3_bucket\"/></p>\n"
"    <p>To stop receiving these alerts, raise the quota, lower the\n"
"        threshold to <code>-1</code> (disabled), or move objects out\n"
"        of the bucket.</p>\n"
"    <p>This alert will not re-fire for at least 7 days while usage\n"
"        remains above the threshold.</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"    <p>Hola,</p>\n"
"    <p>El backend de backup\n"
"        <strong t-out=\"object.name\"/>\n"
"        está actualmente al\n"
"        <strong><t t-out=\"ctx.get('backup_alert_pct_used')\"/>%</strong>\n"
"        de su cuota configurada\n"
"        (<t t-out=\"round(object.last_measured_gb, 2)\"/> GB usados de\n"
"        <t t-out=\"object.quota_gb\"/> GB de cuota; el umbral de aviso es\n"
"        <t t-out=\"ctx.get('backup_alert_threshold_pct')\"/>%).</p>\n"
"    <p>Bucket: <code t-out=\"object.s3_bucket\"/></p>\n"
"    <p>Para dejar de recibir estos avisos, sube la cuota, baja el\n"
"        umbral a <code>-1</code> (desactivado) o mueve objetos fuera\n"
"        del bucket.</p>\n"
"    <p>Este aviso no se repetirá en al menos 7 días mientras el uso\n"
"        siga por encima del umbral.</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"        "

